# Stage 7c's criterion (TASK-24, docs/research/desktop/plan.md): the GUI test
# switches to ua, types a Ukrainian name, switches to cz, types příklad.txt
# through dead keys, and reads both back (ADR-0163). The layouts are us, ua
# and cz in that order (gui.keyboard-layouts until 7f); System+Space (meta)
# switches, and `layout` tells the runner which keys type a letter.
serial init: gui: gpu on its own page
screen Type help to begin, or help tour.
screen ~> _
type echo 
chord meta spc
layout ua
type звіт-2026 ґанок 
chord meta spc
layout cz
# ř, í and á have keys of their own; ď, ó and ň only the dead caron and
# acute (Shift with = and =).
type příklad.txt ďóň
shot layouts-cz
chord meta spc
layout us
type \r
screen звіт-2026 ґанок příklad.txt ďóň
screen ~> _
# INV-0163-4: ls after switching to ua and back.
chord meta spc
chord meta spc
chord meta spc
type ls /texts\r
screen cz/
screen uk/
screen ~> _
type poweroff\r
exit
